    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это что ещё за ерунда?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of nonsense is this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Ты кто такой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты что здесь делаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing in here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Между прочим, уже прошел, меня шеф взял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, I already passed, the Chef hired me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Собеседование прохожу!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am having my job interview!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Шеф, извините меня, пожалуйста, ошибочка вышла.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, please forgive me, there was a little mistake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты принят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are hired.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Будешь работать два через два.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will work two days on, two days off.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Поварам на кухне с бородой нельзя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cooks are not allowed to wear beards in the kitchen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Во-первых, я шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First of all, I am the head chef.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А вы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what about yours?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "А во-вторых.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And secondly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Понимаете, она удачу приносит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You see, my beard brings good luck.'",
      "gap": 0.65
